From 05585292e7c03708ad3146e3195edd57541857a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: localhost-copilot <318096335+localhost-copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 14:59:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] media: t7-vdin: define mapped HDR SDR video profiles

Use ordinary HLG transfer admission and fixed vendor LUT samples.
Apply precise PQ gamut coefficients and signed standalone pre-offsets.
Keep mapped NV12 on the existing 709 limited-range video contract.
HLG is implemented but lacks validation against a real HLG source.
Host table, color and receiver policy tests cover the profile boundaries.

Signed-off-by: localhost-copilot <318096335+localhost-copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
